# Standalone Apple Pay (iOS)

Read `docs/AGENT_HANDOFF_STANDALONE_WALLETS.md` before changing Apple Pay entry points.

Enable/disable is what the merchant passes. Do not add an `NISdk` Apple Pay flag.

- UPP on: `applePayRequest` + `applePayDelegate` in `showCardPaymentViewWith`
- UPP off: `with: nil` and `applePayDelegate: nil`
- Standalone: `initiateApplePayWith` (do not rename)
- Missing `applePayLink` on the standalone path: `.InValidRequest`, not `.PaymentFailed`

Sister Android branch: `feature/standalone-wallet-launchers` on `payment-sdk-android`.
